n="19.755" end="20.859">smile</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">认为笑容 不过转瞬即逝</span></p><p begin="21.413" end="24.795" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="21.413" end="21.654">But</span> <span begin="21.654" end="21.829">it&apos;</span><span begin="21.829" end="22.125">s a</span> <span begin="22.125" end="22.376">rip</span><span begin="22.376" end="22.828">ple</span> <span begin="22.828" end="23.248">in</span> <span begin="23.248" end="23.520">the</span> <span begin="23.520" end="23.893">fa</span><span begin="23.893" end="24.795">bric</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">可它会在命运的织锦上 荡开涟漪</span></p><p begin="25.388" end="28.580" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="25.388" end="25.563">We</span> <span begin="25.563" end="25.845">are</span> <span begin="25.845" end="26.267">all</span> <span begin="26.267" end="26.500">con</span><span begin="26.500" end="26.884">nec</span><span begin="26.884" end="27.213">ted</span> <span begin="27.213" end="28.580">by</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">那片经纬 早已将所有人彼此相连</span></p><p begin="29.291" end="32.084" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="29.291" end="29.548">You</span> <span begin="29.548" end="29.836">thin</span><span begin="29.836" end="30.179">k it</span> <span begin="30.179" end="30.595">doe</span><span begin="30.595" end="30.892">sn&apos;t</span> <span begin="30.892" end="31.308">mat</span><span begin="31.308" end="32.084">ter</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">你以为自己的悲喜无人察觉</span></p><p begin="32.780" end="35.796" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="32.780" end="33.004">When</span> <span begin="33.004" end="33.236">your</span> <span begin="33.236" end="33.698">sad</span><span begin="33.698" end="33.946">ness</span> <span begin="33.946" end="34.216">ma</span><span begin="34.216" end="34.329">kes</span> <span begin="34.329" end="34.523">you</span> <span begin="34.523" end="35.796">cry</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">哪怕忧伤化作眼中的泪</span></p><p begin="36.242" end="39.705" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="36.242" end="36.452">But</span> <span begin="36.452" end="36.633">it&apos;</span><span begin="36.633" end="36.913">s a</span> <span begin="36.913" end="37.314">pull</span> <span begin="37.314" end="38.014">upon</span> <span begin="38.014" end="38.245">the</span> <span begin="38.245" end="38.643">fa</span><span begin="38.643" end="39.705">bric</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">可每一滴泪 都会牵动那幅长锦</span></p><p begin="40.115" end="43.187" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="40.115" end="40.585">That</span> <span begin="40.585" end="41.043">weaves</span> <span begin="41.043" end="41.305">your</span> <span begin="41.305" end="41.738">life</span> <span begin="41.738" end="41.994">to</span> <span begin="41.994" end="43.187">mine</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">让你我的生命 在此刻交织</span></p><p begin="43.363" end="50.418" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="43.363" end="44.291">That</span> <span begin="44.291" end="47.018">weaves,</span> <span begin="47.018" end="47.954">that</span> <span begin="47.954" end="48.443">weaves</span> <span begin="48.443" end="48.690">your</span> <span begin="48.690" end="49.140">life</span> <span begin="49.140" end="49.394">to</span> <span begin="49.394" end="50.418">mine</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">你我的影子 相互牵连</span></p><p begin="50.810" end="56.250" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="50.810" end="51.684">That</span> <span begin="51.684" end="52.552">weaves</span> <span begin="52.552" end="53.448">your</span> <span begin="53.448" end="54.207">life</span> <span begin="54.207" end="54.833">to</span> <span begin="54.833" end="56.250">mine</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">你走过的路 延伸进我的人生</span></p><p begin="57.472" end="1:00.936" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="57.472" end="57.573">Be</span><span begin="57.573" end="57.852">cause</span> <span begin="57.852" end="58.147">it&apos;s</span> <span begin="58.147" end="58.368">big</span><span begin="58.368" end="58.586">ger</span> <span begin="58.586" end="59.057">than</span> <span begin="59.057" end="1:00.936">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">因为这一切超越了你</span></p><p begin="1:01.594" end="1:05.544" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:01.594" end="1:01.806">It&apos;s</span> <span begin="1:01.806" end="1:02.056">big</span><span begin="1:02.056" end="1:02.269">ger</span> <span begin="1:02.269" end="1:02.748">than</span> <span begin="1:02.748" end="1:05.544">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">也超越了我</span></p><p begin="1:06.257" end="1:10.731" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:06.257" end="1:06.472">It&apos;s</span> <span begin="1:06.472" end="1:06.705">big</span><span begin="1:06.705" end="1:06.912">ger</span> <span begin="1:06.912" end="1:07.377">than</span> <span begin="1:07.377" end="1:07.836">al</span><span begin="1:07.836" end="1:08.072">l o</span><span begin="1:08.072" end="1:10.731">f us</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">它超越了我们所有人</span></p><p begin="1:12.699" end="1:15.646" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:12.699" end="1:12.929">It&apos;s</span> <span begin="1:12.929" end="1:13.128">big</span><span begin="1:13.128" end="1:13.360">ger</span> <span begin="1:13.360" end="1:13.776">than</span> <span begin="1:13.776" end="1:15.646">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">它从来不只属于你</span></p><p begin="1:16.344" end="1:20.283" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:16.344" end="1:16.574">It&apos;s</span> <span begin="1:16.574" end="1:16.807">big</span><span begin="1:16.807" end="1:17.031">ger</span> <span begin="1:17.031" end="1:17.479">than</span> <span begin="1:17.479" end="1:20.283">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">也不会止步于我</span></p><p begin="1:20.978" end="1:25.816" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:20.978" end="1:21.240">It&apos;s</span> <span begin="1:21.240" end="1:21.488">big</span><span begin="1:21.488" end="1:21.694">ger</span> <span begin="1:21.694" end="1:22.142">than</span> <span begin="1:22.142" end="1:22.5