slation">哪怕羞愧让你躲进无人的阴影</span></p><p begin="1:43.135" end="1:45.909" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:43.135" end="1:43.374">You</span> <span begin="1:43.374" end="1:43.727">thin</span><span begin="1:43.727" end="1:44.021">k your</span> <span begin="1:44.021" end="1:44.431">joy</span> <span begin="1:44.431" end="1:44.719">is</span> <span begin="1:44.719" end="1:45.077">no</span><span begin="1:45.077" end="1:45.909">thing</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">你以为自己的喜悦微不足道</span></p><p begin="1:46.517" end="1:49.574" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:46.517" end="1:46.782">How</span> <span begin="1:46.782" end="1:47.055">could</span> <span begin="1:47.055" end="1:47.477">laugh</span><span begin="1:47.477" end="1:47.718">ter</span> <span begin="1:47.718" end="1:48.158">change</span> <span begin="1:48.158" end="1:48.431">the</span> <span begin="1:48.431" end="1:49.574">world?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">片刻笑意 又怎能颠覆天地</span></p><p begin="1:50.278" end="1:53.373" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:50.278" end="1:50.517">How</span> <span begin="1:50.517" end="1:50.767">can</span> <span begin="1:50.767" end="1:51.174">just</span> <span begin="1:51.174" end="1:51.439">one</span> <span begin="1:51.439" end="1:51.829">ac</span><span begin="1:51.829" end="1:52.060">t of</span> <span begin="1:52.060" end="1:52.550">kind</span><span begin="1:52.550" end="1:53.373">ness</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">难道一次微小的温柔</span></p><p begin="1:53.898" end="1:57.567" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:53.898" end="1:54.174">Change</span> <span begin="1:54.174" end="1:54.447">the</span> <span begin="1:54.447" end="1:54.846">way</span> <span begin="1:54.846" end="1:55.078">a</span> <span begin="1:55.078" end="1:55.494">li</span><span begin="1:55.494" end="1:55.966">fe un</span><span begin="1:55.966" end="1:57.567">furls?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">竟能改变人生的轨迹？</span></p><p begin="1:58.059" end="2:04.654" itunes:key="L25" ttm: